# Epstein internal module — vendored third-party trees and generated dumps.
# These came in wholesale when the module was copied from D:\cs2-newww and are
# not our code: imgui and minhook ship their own .github/, .editorconfig and
# .gitattributes, which is where the bulk of the noise came from. Re-copy them
# from the original module folder if the tree is ever cloned fresh.
src/internal/EpsteinModule/imgui-master/
src/internal/EpsteinModule/minhook-master/
src/internal/EpsteinModule/sdk/
src/internal/EpsteinModule/*.jpg
src/internal/EpsteinModule/*.png
src/internal/EpsteinModule/epstein.log

